{'symbol': 'LNT', 'date': '2023-03-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'COMMUNITIES RECEIVED $12.1M FROM ALLIANT ENERGY IN 2022', 'text': "MADISON, WIS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WITH A COMMITMENT TO SERVING CUSTOMERS AND BUILDING STRONGER COMMUNITIES, ALLIANT ENERGY AND THE COMPANY'S CHARITABLE FOUNDATION, ALONG WITH THE COMPANY'S EMPLOYEES AND RETIREES, COLLECTIVELY CONTRIBUTED $12.1 MILLION AND VOLUNTEERED OVER 70,000 HOURS IN 2022."}